Vendored into FlowGuard as the demo application that the CI pipeline builds, tests, scans and
deploys. Kept unmodified: cmd/, pkg/, ui/, go.mod, go.sum, Dockerfile, Dockerfile.xx, Makefile,
LICENSE, README.md, .gitignore. Not vendored: the upstream CI workflows, Helm charts, deploy/,
kustomize/, timoni/, otel/, test/ and release-signing files.
Changes made in FlowGuard, if any, are listed below with their date and reason.

Changes:
2026-10-25  Security fixes (FlowGuard decision D24). Go toolchain 1.23 -> 1.26.10 (go.mod
            toolchain, Dockerfile, Dockerfile.xx; Go 1.25 is end-of-life and cannot take the
            fixes). Modules: google.golang.org/grpc 1.67.1 -> 1.83.2, golang.org/x/net 0.30.0
            -> 0.60.0, golang.org/x/text replace floor 0.19.0 -> 0.42.0, go.opentelemetry.io/otel
            and otel/sdk 1.30.0 -> 1.44.0, github.com/golang-jwt/jwt/v4 4.5.0 -> 4.5.2,
            github.com/klauspost/compress 1.17.9 -> 1.18.7, and the versions they require.
            'as' -> 'AS' in both Dockerfiles. No source code changed.
